-- EU AI Act serious-incident reporting: INDEPENDENT tests.
-- DRAFT. Not for use as advice. See NOTES.md.
--
-- Written by a test author who had not seen the encoding being written.
-- Every expected value was decided from the deposited sources alone and
-- written down (answers-first.md, in the coordinator's scratchpad) BEFORE any
-- file in this folder was opened; the encoding was then read only to learn
-- its names. No expectation was adjusted to match the code: an assertion that
-- fails is a finding.
--
-- Citations: A:n is a line of registers/source-bundle/eu-ai-act-2024-1689.txt,
-- O:n a line of registers/source-bundle/eu-omnibus-2026-1744.txt.
-- Day counting (answers-first F1): the day of awareness is day 0, "not later
-- than N days after" makes awareness + N the last day in time; calendar days.
-- February 2028 has 29 days; February 2027 and 2029 have 28.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-domain`
IMPORT `aia-dates`
IMPORT `aia-definitions`
IMPORT `aia-art73`
IMPORT `aia-gpai`
IMPORT `aia-penalties`
IMPORT `aia-seat`

§ `Independent tests`

§§ `Independent fixtures`

-- A system I develop, place on the Union market under my own name.
GIVEN r IS A `high-risk route`, placedon IS A DATE, chg IS A MAYBE DATE, pub IS A BOOLEAN, owngpai IS A BOOLEAN, pt2 IS A BOOLEAN, vlp IS A BOOLEAN, dev IS A BOOLEAN, eqv IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `AI system facts`
`ind system` r placedon chg pub owngpai pt2 vlp dev eqv MEANS
    `AI system facts` WITH
        `I develop the system or have it developed`                                   IS TRUE
        `I place the system on the market or put it into service`                     IS TRUE
        `the system carries my own name or trademark`                                 IS TRUE
        `the route by which the system is high-risk`                                  IS r
        `the system has been placed on the Union market`                              IS TRUE
        `the date the system was first placed on the market or put into service`      IS placedon
        `the date of the latest significant change to its design, if any`            IS chg
        `the system is intended to be used by public authorities`                     IS pub
        `the system is based on a general-purpose AI model from me or my undertaking` IS owngpai
        `the system is listed in point 2 of Annex III`                                IS pt2
        `the system is listed in point 8 of Annex III for the administration of justice` IS FALSE
        `the system is provided by an authority or financial institution within Article 74(6)` IS FALSE
        `the system is or is part of a designated very large online platform or search engine` IS vlp
        `the system is or is a safety component of a device under Regulation 2017/745 or 2017/746` IS dev
        `I am subject to Union instruments with equivalent incident-reporting obligations` IS eqv

-- An incident of the AI system. wide: an act contrary to Union law protecting
-- individuals that harmed residents of two other Member States (Art 3(61)(a)).
GIVEN dth IS A BOOLEAN, hlth IS A BOOLEAN, infra IS A BOOLEAN, rts IS A BOOLEAN, prop IS A BOOLEAN, wide IS A BOOLEAN, aw IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `incident facts`
`ind incident` dth hlth infra rts prop wide aw MEANS
    `incident facts` WITH
        `it is an incident or malfunctioning of the AI system`                               IS TRUE
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to the death of a person`                           IS dth
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to the health of a person`          IS hlth
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to a serious and irreversible disruption of critical infrastructure` IS infra
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to an infringement of Union-law obligations protecting fundamental rights` IS rts
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to property or the environment`     IS prop
        `it is an act or omission contrary to Union law protecting the interest of individuals` IS wide
        `the number of other Member States whose residents it harmed or is likely to harm`   IS (IF wide THEN 2 ELSE 0)
        `it has common features, such as the same unlawful practice or interest infringed`   IS FALSE
        `it is committed by the same operator`                                               IS FALSE
        `the number of Member States in which it is occurring concurrently`                  IS 0
        `the date I became aware of it`                                                      IS aw

-- A general-purpose AI model I develop and place on the market under my name.
GIVEN fl IS A NUMBER, ev IS A BOOLEAN, des IS A BOOLEAN, pl IS A DATE
GIVETH A `model facts`
`ind model` fl ev des pl MEANS
    `model facts` WITH
        `I develop the model or have it developed`                              IS TRUE
        `I place the model on the market under my own name or trademark`        IS TRUE
        `it is a general-purpose AI model`                                      IS TRUE
        `the cumulative training computation in floating point operations`     IS fl
        `an evaluation with appropriate technical tools found high impact capabilities` IS ev
        `the Commission has designated it a model with systemic risk`           IS des
        `the Commission has accepted my Article 52(2) arguments`               IS FALSE
        `the date the model was first placed on the market`                    IS pl

-- True when a deadline is "no period stated", whatever words it carries.
GIVEN dl IS A `deadline`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`ind no period stated` dl MEANS
    CONSIDER dl
    WHEN `no period stated` w THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

`ind amended` MEANS `as amended by Regulation (EU) 2026/1744`
`ind enacted` MEANS `as enacted`
`ind annex iii` MEANS `Article 6(2), listed in Annex III`
`ind section a` MEANS `Article 6(1), product under Section A of Annex I`
`ind section b` MEANS `Article 6(1), product under Section B of Annex I`
`ind msa` MEANS `the market surveillance authorities of the Member States where the incident occurred`

-- An Annex III system placed 10 Dec 2027: after the amended Art 111(2)
-- cut-off (2 Dec 2027) and the enacted one (2 Aug 2026), so no grace.
`ind s3` MEANS `ind system` `ind annex iii` (YearMonthDay 2027 12 10) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE

-- A model over 10^25 FLOP placed 1 Sep 2025 (after Chapter V applies).
`ind sr model` MEANS `ind model` 20_000_000_000_000_000_000_000_000 FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 9 1)
-- The same model placed 1 Jul 2025 (before 2 Aug 2025: Art 111(3)).
`ind legacy model` MEANS `ind model` 20_000_000_000_000_000_000_000_000 FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 7 1)
-- A model below the presumption, not evaluated, not designated.
`ind small model` MEANS `ind model` 1_000_000_000_000_000_000_000_000 FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 9 1)

