§§ `(a) Who is outside Article 73`

-- Not high-risk.
#ASSERT `by when must I report under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 2 14) `ind amended` (`ind system` `not a high-risk AI system` (YearMonthDay 2027 12 10) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`ind incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2028 2 14)) EQUALS `no duty applies to me`
-- Section B of Annex I: Art 2(2), both vintages.
#ASSERT NOT (`must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1) `ind amended` (`ind system` `ind section b` (YearMonthDay 2028 8 10) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`ind incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1)))
#ASSERT NOT (`must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1) `ind enacted` (`ind system` `ind section b` (YearMonthDay 2028 8 10) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`ind incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1)))
-- Art 73(9): Annex III, provider under equivalent Union reporting law: only
-- point (c) incidents. A death is not reported; a rights infringement is.
#ASSERT NOT (`must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 2 19) `ind amended` (`ind system` `ind annex iii` (YearMonthDay 2027 12 10) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) (`ind incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2028 2 19)))
#ASSERT `must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 2 19) `ind amended` (`ind system` `ind annex iii` (YearMonthDay 2027 12 10) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) (`ind incident` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2028 2 19))
-- Art 73(10): medical device (an Annex I Section A product), amended, placed
-- after 2 Aug 2028. A death is not reported; a point (c) incident goes to the
-- national competent authority the Member State chose.
#ASSERT NOT (`must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1) `ind amended` (`ind system` `ind section a` (YearMonthDay 2028 8 10) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE) (`ind incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1)))
#ASSERT `to whom must I report under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1) `ind amended` (`ind system` `ind section a` (YearMonthDay 2028 8 10) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE) (`ind incident` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1)) EQUALS `the national competent authority chosen by the Member State where the incident occurred`
-- Art 111(2) grace, as amended: Annex III placed 1 Jun 2027 (before 2 Dec
-- 2027), unchanged: no duty on 1 Mar 2028; changed 15 Jan 2028: duty.
#ASSERT NOT (`must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1) `ind amended` (`ind system` `ind annex iii` (YearMonthDay 2027 6 1) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`ind incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1)))
#ASSERT `must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1) `ind amended` (`ind system` `ind annex iii` (YearMonthDay 2027 6 1) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2028 1 15)) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`ind incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1))
-- Art 111(2) grace, as enacted: placed 1 Jun 2026 (before 2 Aug 2026),
-- unchanged: no duty on 1 Sep 2026; placed 1 Sep 2026: duty on 10 Sep 2026.
#ASSERT NOT (`must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) `ind enacted` (`ind system` `ind annex iii` (YearMonthDay 2026 6 1) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`ind incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1)))
#ASSERT `must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2026 9 10) `ind enacted` (`ind system` `ind annex iii` (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`ind incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 9 10))

§§ `(c) Dates of application of Article 73 (new system placed on the day asked)`

-- Annex III, as enacted: from 2 Aug 2026 (A:2199).
#ASSERT NOT (`must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2026 8 1) `ind enacted` (`ind system` `ind annex iii` (YearMonthDay 2026 8 1) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`ind incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 8 1)))
#ASSERT `must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2026 8 2) `ind enacted` (`ind system` `ind annex iii` (YearMonthDay 2026 8 2) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`ind incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 8 2))
