§§ `(c) Who receives the Article 73 report, by vintage (O:417-434)`

-- Annex III system built on my own GPAI model.
#ASSERT `to whom must I report under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1) `ind amended` (`ind system` `ind annex iii` (YearMonthDay 2027 12 10) NOTHING FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`ind incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1)) EQUALS `the AI Office`
#ASSERT `to whom must I report under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1) `ind enacted` (`ind system` `ind annex iii` (YearMonthDay 2027 12 10) NOTHING FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`ind incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1)) EQUALS `ind msa`
-- The same, but in Annex III point 2: exception (ii) keeps it national.
#ASSERT `to whom must I report under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1) `ind amended` (`ind system` `ind annex iii` (YearMonthDay 2027 12 10) NOTHING FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`ind incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1)) EQUALS `ind msa`
-- Part of a designated VLOP/VLOSE, not built on my GPAI model.
#ASSERT `to whom must I report under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1) `ind amended` (`ind system` `ind annex iii` (YearMonthDay 2027 12 10) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE) (`ind incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1)) EQUALS `the AI Office`
#ASSERT `to whom must I report under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1) `ind enacted` (`ind system` `ind annex iii` (YearMonthDay 2027 12 10) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE) (`ind incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1)) EQUALS `ind msa`
