-- Section A product built on my GPAI model: exception (i) keeps it national.
#ASSERT `to whom must I report under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1) `ind amended` (`ind system` `ind section a` (YearMonthDay 2028 8 10) NOTHING FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`ind incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1)) EQUALS `ind msa`
