#ASSERT `the most I can be fined for not reporting under Article 55(1)(c)` (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) `ind sr model` (`ind incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1)) 100_000_000 EQUALS `up to` 15_000_000
#ASSERT `the most I can be fined for not reporting under Article 55(1)(c)` (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) `ind sr model` (`ind incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1)) 500_000_000 EQUALS `up to` 15_000_000
-- An SME's turnover: still "whichever is higher" (no SME rule in Art 101).
#ASSERT `the most I can be fined for not reporting under Article 55(1)(c)` (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) `ind sr model` (`ind incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1)) 10_000_000 EQUALS `up to` 15_000_000
