§§ `(d) Penalties: Article 73, by supervisor and vintage`

-- Nationally supervised: no ceiling in the Regulation, both vintages.
#ASSERT `the most I can be fined for not reporting under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1) `ind enacted` `ind s3` (`ind incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1)) `another undertaking` 1_000_000_000 EQUALS `no maximum in this Regulation: the Member State rules under Article 99(1)`
#ASSERT `the most I can be fined for not reporting under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1) `ind amended` `ind s3` (`ind incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1)) `another undertaking` 1_000_000_000 EQUALS `no maximum in this Regulation: the Member State rules under Article 99(1)`
-- AI-Office-supervised (own GPAI), as amended: Art 75c(4)(a) -> 99(4).
#ASSERT `the most I can be fined for not reporting under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1) `ind amended` (`ind system` `ind annex iii` (YearMonthDay 2027 12 10) NOTHING FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`ind incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1)) `another undertaking` 1_000_000_000 EQUALS `up to` 30_000_000
#ASSERT `the most I can be fined for not reporting under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1) `ind amended` (`ind system` `ind annex iii` (YearMonthDay 2027 12 10) NOTHING FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`ind incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1)) `another undertaking` 100_000_000 EQUALS `up to` 15_000_000
#ASSERT `the most I can be fined for not reporting under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1) `ind amended` (`ind system` `ind annex iii` (YearMonthDay 2027 12 10) NOTHING FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`ind incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1)) `an SME, including a start-up` 40_000_000 EQUALS `up to` 1_200_000
#ASSERT `the most I can be fined for not reporting under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1) `ind amended` (`ind system` `ind annex iii` (YearMonthDay 2027 12 10) NOTHING FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`ind incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1)) `an SMC, a small mid-cap enterprise` 200_000_000 EQUALS `up to` 6_000_000
-- The same facts as enacted: no Art 75c, so no ceiling.
#ASSERT `the most I can be fined for not reporting under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1) `ind enacted` (`ind system` `ind annex iii` (YearMonthDay 2027 12 10) NOTHING FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`ind incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2028 3 1)) `another undertaking` 1_000_000_000 EQUALS `no maximum in this Regulation: the Member State rules under Article 99(1)`

